Package: wiretap-appliance
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Alex Ferrara <alex@wiredsquare.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: init-system-helpers (>= 1.54), adduser, ca-certificates
Suggests: wiretap-server, network-manager, bluez, avahi-daemon, libnss-mdns
Description: administers a WireTAP capture appliance from a browser
 Built on the Wired Square appliance chassis. Serves its interface over TLS.
 .
 It keeps a control socket for an operator in the wiretap-appliance group, which is the
 way in when nobody can sign in:
 .
   /run/wiretap-appliance/wiretap-appliance.sock
